{"id":"forecast-14","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-14/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":366.5,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.64,"text":"Part 3 You'll hear a third-year student called Emma talking","words":[["Part",0.0,0.24],["3",0.24,0.7],["You'll",0.7,2.42],["hear",2.42,2.68],["a",2.68,2.98],["third",2.98,3.18],["-year",3.18,3.44],["student",3.44,3.94],["called",3.94,4.38],["Emma",4.38,4.76],["talking",4.76,5.64]]},{"start":5.64,"end":12.16,"text":"to a first-year student called John about the work experience John must do as part of his","words":[["to",5.64,5.96],["a",5.96,6.14],["first",6.14,6.36],["-year",6.36,6.64],["student",6.64,7.14],["called",7.14,7.46],["John",7.46,7.86],["about",7.86,8.78],["the",8.78,9.02],["work",9.02,9.26],["experience",9.26,9.96],["John",9.96,10.38],["must",10.38,10.66],["do",10.66,11.02],["as",11.02,11.6],["part",11.6,11.84],["of",11.84,11.98],["his",11.98,12.16]]},{"start":12.16,"end":17.92,"text":"software engineering course. First you have some time to look at questions","words":[["software",12.16,12.74],["engineering",12.74,13.42],["course.",13.42,14.06],["First",15.36,16.1],["you",16.1,16.32],["have",16.32,16.48],["some",16.48,16.68],["time",16.68,17.1],["to",17.1,17.34],["look",17.34,17.48],["at",17.48,17.64],["questions",17.64,17.92]]},{"start":17.92,"end":54.51,"text":"21 to 24. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["21",17.92,18.8],["to",18.8,19.08],["24.",19.08,19.68],["Now",50.09,50.65],["listen",50.65,51.01],["carefully",51.01,51.47],["and",51.47,51.85],["answer",51.85,52.27],["questions",52.27,52.63],["21",52.63,53.59],["to",53.59,53.85],["24.",53.85,54.51]]},{"start":57.88,"end":61.72,"text":"Oh, John, you wanted some advice about the work experience program?","words":[["Oh,",57.88,58.4],["John,",58.44,58.7],["you",59.12,59.46],["wanted",59.46,59.66],["some",59.66,59.9],["advice",59.9,60.24],["about",60.24,60.44],["the",60.44,60.6],["work",60.6,60.76],["experience",60.76,61.3],["program?",61.3,61.72]]},{"start":62.18,"end":65.32,"text":"Yeah, I wanted to check I've understood what I'm supposed to do.","words":[["Yeah,",62.18,62.52],["I",62.74,62.88],["wanted",62.88,63.12],["to",63.12,63.32],["check",63.32,63.5],["I've",63.5,63.72],["understood",63.72,64.06],["what",64.06,64.32],["I'm",64.32,64.48],["supposed",64.48,64.72],["to",64.72,65.0],["do.",65.0,65.32]]},{"start":65.6,"end":65.9,"text":"Sure.","words":[["Sure.",65.6,65.9]]},{"start":66.46,"end":70.8,"text":"For a start, we have to work for a company in the holidays between the first and second year,","words":[["For",66.46,66.68],["a",66.68,66.8],["start,",66.8,67.0],["we",67.32,67.38],["have",67.38,67.54],["to",67.54,67.66],["work",67.66,67.84],["for",67.84,68.02],["a",68.02,68.14],["company",68.14,68.48],["in",68.48,68.64],["the",68.64,68.74],["holidays",68.74,69.12],["between",69.12,69.5],["the",69.5,69.76],["first",69.76,69.98],["and",69.98,70.16],["second",70.16,70.44],["year,",70.44,70.8]]},{"start":71.12,"end":73.3,"text":"and again between the second and third year, right?","words":[["and",71.12,71.36],["again",71.36,71.6],["between",71.6,71.86],["the",71.86,72.06],["second",72.06,72.28],["and",72.28,72.46],["third",72.46,72.76],["year,",72.76,73.02],["right?",73.14,73.3]]},{"start":73.74,"end":79.2,"text":"Yes, usually you do around 50 days with two different employers, like 100 days in total.","words":[["Yes,",73.74,74.1],["usually",74.24,74.56],["you",74.56,74.8],["do",74.8,74.92],["around",74.92,75.22],["50",75.22,75.56],["days",75.56,75.88],["with",75.88,76.12],["two",76.12,76.34],["different",76.34,76.7],["employers,",76.7,77.4],["like",77.8,78.16],["100",78.16,78.48],["days",78.48,78.74],["in",78.74,78.88],["total.",78.88,79.2]]},{"start":79.84,"end":84.64,"text":"I see. You know, there's one aspect of the work experience program I'm unhappy with.","words":[["I",79.84,80.04],["see.",80.04,80.32],["You",80.84,81.0],["know,",81.0,81.12],["there's",81.24,81.44],["one",81.44,81.64],["aspect",81.64,82.04],["of",82.04,82.24],["the",82.24,82.36],["work",82.36,82.52],["experience",82.52,82.88],["program",82.88,83.42],["I'm",83.42,83.84],["unhappy",83.84,84.34],["with.",84.34,84.64]]},{"start":84.64,"end":90.14,"text":"I mean, considering we have to attend a preparation course for it, and that it's a big investment","words":[["I",84.64,85.06],["mean,",85.06,85.26],["considering",85.56,85.96],["we",85.96,86.3],["have",86.3,86.52],["to",86.52,86.68],["attend",86.68,87.0],["a",87.0,87.16],["preparation",87.16,87.52],["course",87.52,88.1],["for",88.1,88.38],["it,",88.38,88.56],["and",88.74,89.12],["that",89.12,89.28],["it's",89.28,89.4],["a",89.4,89.54],["big",89.54,89.68],["investment",89.68,90.14]]},{"start":90.14,"end":91.2,"text":"in terms of time.","words":[["in",90.14,90.38],["terms",90.38,90.62],["of",90.62,90.8],["time.",90.8,91.2]]},{"start":91.5,"end":92.28,"text":"What's the problem?","words":[["What's",91.5,91.9],["the",91.9,92.0],["problem?",92.0,92.28]]},{"start":92.84,"end":97.96,"text":"Just the fact that no matter how well we perform on the program, it makes no difference whatsoever","words":[["Just",92.84,93.1],["the",93.1,93.26],["fact",93.26,93.52],["that",93.52,93.68],["no",93.68,93.9],["matter",93.9,94.1],["how",94.1,94.38],["well",94.38,94.64],["we",94.64,94.82],["perform",94.82,95.14],["on",95.14,95.32],["the",95.32,95.42],["program,",95.42,95.9],["it",96.46,96.54],["makes",96.54,96.76],["no",96.76,97.02],["difference",97.02,97.34],["whatsoever",97.34,97.96]]},{"start":97.96,"end":99.78,"text":"to our final grade for our degree.","words":[["to",97.96,98.22],["our",98.22,98.38],["final",98.38,98.7],["grade",98.7,99.06],["for",99.06,99.26],["our",99.26,99.44],["degree.",99.44,99.78]]},{"start":100.2,"end":101.38,"text":"It goes unrecognised.","words":[["It",100.2,100.3],["goes",100.3,100.52],["unrecognised.",100.52,101.38]]},{"start":101.6,"end":104.14,"text":"I know, but there are lots of advantages too.","words":[["I",101.6,101.76],["know,",101.76,102.04],["but",102.26,102.42],["there",102.42,102.66],["are",102.66,102.94],["lots",102.94,103.16],["of",103.16,103.32],["advantages",103.32,103.72],["too.",103.72,104.14]]},{"start":104.72,"end":108.14,"text":"Anyway, when does your preparation course for the work experience start?","words":[["Anyway,",104.72,104.98],["when",105.5,105.66],["does",105.66,105.84],["your",105.84,105.98],["preparation",105.98,106.44],["course",106.44,106.84],["for",106.84,107.02],["the",107.02,107.1],["work",107.1,107.26],["experience",107.26,107.58],["start?",107.58,108.14]]},{"start":108.58,"end":108.9,"text":"Soon.","words":[["Soon.",108.58,108.9]]},{"start":109.24,"end":112.92,"text":"We're starting with a session on interview technique, how to respond to questions,","words":[["We're",109.24,109.44],["starting",109.44,109.72],["with",109.72,109.9],["a",109.9,110.02],["session",110.02,110.28],["on",110.28,110.5],["interview",110.5,110.86],["technique,",110.86,111.3],["how",111.76,111.92],["to",111.92,112.02],["respond",112.02,112.3],["to",112.3,112.48],["questions,",112.48,112.92]]},{"start":113.18,"end":113.6,"text":"that stuff.","words":[["that",113.18,113.3],["stuff.",113.3,113.6]]},{"start":113.6,"end":118.3,"text":"That can be useful, but I remember we had to make up a list of things we wanted to achieve","words":[["That",113.6,114.06],["can",114.06,114.2],["be",114.2,114.36],["useful,",114.36,114.7],["but",115.32,115.46],["I",115.46,115.56],["remember",115.56,115.76],["we",115.76,116.02],["had",116.02,116.16],["to",116.16,116.3],["make",116.3,116.46],["up",116.46,116.6],["a",116.6,116.72],["list",116.72,116.94],["of",116.94,117.14],["things",117.14,117.38],["we",117.38,117.58],["wanted",117.58,117.76],["to",117.76,117.94],["achieve",117.94,118.3]]},{"start":118.3,"end":121.02,"text":"during the time with the employer. That was a bit pointless.","words":[["during",118.3,118.6],["the",118.6,118.76],["time",118.76,119.04],["with",119.04,119.2],["the",119.2,119.3],["employer.",119.3,119.64],["That",120.06,120.22],["was",120.22,120.36],["a",120.36,120.48],["bit",120.48,120.58],["pointless.",120.58,121.02]]},{"start":121.46,"end":125.72,"text":"My thoughts exactly. You can't decide on your aims until you've started work for real.","words":[["My",121.46,121.64],["thoughts",121.64,121.86],["exactly.",121.86,122.38],["You",122.98,123.14],["can't",123.14,123.4],["decide",123.4,123.62],["on",123.62,123.84],["your",123.84,123.98],["aims",123.98,124.22],["until",124.22,124.48],["you've",124.48,124.7],["started",124.7,124.98],["work",124.98,125.26],["for",125.26,125.46],["real.",125.46,125.72]]},{"start":126.18,"end":130.04,"text":"The tutor will give you some good advice about presenting your resume though, so don't","words":[["The",126.18,126.34],["tutor",126.34,126.52],["will",126.52,126.72],["give",126.72,126.88],["you",126.88,127.04],["some",127.04,127.22],["good",127.22,127.4],["advice",127.4,127.8],["about",127.8,128.04],["presenting",128.04,128.4],["your",128.4,128.66],["resume",128.66,128.92],["though,",128.92,129.28],["so",129.56,129.86],["don't",129.86,130.04]]},{"start":130.04,"end":130.82,"text":"miss that session.","words":[["miss",130.04,130.26],["that",130.26,130.48],["session.",130.48,130.82]]},{"start":131.34,"end":135.68,"text":"OK. When the work experience starts for real, it would be great if I could actually do","words":[["OK.",131.34,131.78],["When",132.44,132.68],["the",132.68,132.78],["work",132.78,132.92],["experience",132.92,133.22],["starts",133.22,133.6],["for",133.6,133.84],["real,",133.84,134.1],["it",134.32,134.38],["would",134.38,134.5],["be",134.5,134.64],["great",134.64,134.88],["if",134.88,135.02],["I",135.02,135.14],["could",135.14,135.26],["actually",135.26,135.52],["do",135.52,135.68]]},{"start":135.68,"end":136.8,"text":"a bit of software design.","words":[["a",135.68,135.82],["bit",135.82,135.9],["of",135.9,136.02],["software",136.02,136.34],["design.",136.34,136.8]]},{"start":137.16,"end":141.66,"text":"That's highly unlikely on a work experience course. You'll be doing more basic things","words":[["That's",137.16,137.54],["highly",137.54,137.78],["unlikely",137.78,138.24],["on",138.24,138.52],["a",138.52,138.62],["work",138.62,138.76],["experience",138.76,139.26],["course.",139.26,139.62],["You'll",140.24,140.44],["be",140.44,140.52],["doing",140.52,140.72],["more",140.72,140.94],["basic",140.94,141.28],["things",141.28,141.66]]},{"start":141.66,"end":146.84,"text":"than that. But they might start you off on the IT help desk. That's often where they need extra","words":[["than",141.66,141.94],["that.",141.94,142.18],["But",142.7,142.8],["they",142.8,142.88],["might",142.88,143.04],["start",143.04,143.3],["you",143.3,143.54],["off",143.54,143.74],["on",143.74,143.88],["the",143.88,144.0],["IT",144.0,144.36],["help",144.36,144.7],["desk.",144.7,145.08],["That's",145.36,145.6],["often",145.6,145.88],["where",145.88,146.12],["they",146.12,146.28],["need",146.28,146.52],["extra",146.52,146.84]]},{"start":146.84,"end":152.66,"text":"people. But then you'll move on to work in areas that suit your field of study. I mean, whatever","words":[["people.",146.84,147.24],["But",147.76,148.04],["then",148.04,148.24],["you'll",148.24,148.44],["move",148.44,148.6],["on",148.6,148.82],["to",148.82,148.98],["work",148.98,149.18],["in",149.18,149.32],["areas",149.32,149.68],["that",149.68,149.88],["suit",149.88,150.1],["your",150.1,150.32],["field",150.32,150.6],["of",150.6,150.72],["study.",150.72,150.98],["I",151.74,151.9],["mean,",151.9,152.02],["whatever",152.38,152.66]]},{"start":152.66,"end":157.34,"text":"you've focused on this year at college, you need to be able to put it into practice during work","words":[["you've",152.66,153.1],["focused",153.1,153.34],["on",153.34,153.6],["this",153.6,153.8],["year",153.8,154.0],["at",154.0,154.12],["college,",154.12,154.46],["you",154.82,155.04],["need",155.04,155.14],["to",155.14,155.24],["be",155.24,155.34],["able",155.34,155.46],["to",155.46,155.6],["put",155.6,155.76],["it",155.76,155.86],["into",155.86,156.1],["practice",156.1,156.6],["during",156.6,157.04],["work",157.04,157.34]]},{"start":157.34,"end":162.92,"text":"experience. There has to be a match. And then we do work experience again after we finish our","words":[["experience.",157.34,157.88],["There",158.5,158.72],["has",158.72,158.86],["to",158.86,158.98],["be",158.98,159.1],["a",159.1,159.18],["match.",159.18,159.4],["And",159.96,160.36],["then",160.36,160.46],["we",160.46,160.58],["do",160.58,160.72],["work",160.72,160.96],["experience",160.96,161.42],["again",161.42,161.88],["after",161.88,162.38],["we",162.38,162.52],["finish",162.52,162.72],["our",162.72,162.92]]},{"start":162.92,"end":168.48,"text":"second year, right? I saw somewhere you can expect to earn between $20 to $25 per hour.","words":[["second",162.92,163.28],["year,",163.28,163.58],["right?",163.68,163.84],["I",164.52,164.7],["saw",164.7,164.94],["somewhere",164.94,165.32],["you",165.32,165.54],["can",165.54,165.66],["expect",165.66,165.92],["to",165.92,166.14],["earn",166.14,166.26],["between",166.26,166.52],["$20",166.52,166.96],["to",166.96,167.16],["$25",167.16,167.72],["per",167.72,168.14],["hour.",168.14,168.48]]},{"start":168.48,"end":171.44,"text":"I suppose that's roughly what recent graduates get.","words":[["I",168.48,169.12],["suppose",169.12,169.36],["that's",169.36,169.78],["roughly",169.78,170.1],["what",170.1,170.38],["recent",170.38,170.7],["graduates",170.7,171.18],["get.",171.18,171.44]]},{"start":171.76,"end":172.58,"text":"Yes, not bad.","words":[["Yes,",171.76,172.04],["not",172.18,172.26],["bad.",172.26,172.58]]},{"start":173.12,"end":176.14,"text":"But I also read employees don't necessarily have to pay you anything,","words":[["But",173.12,173.32],["I",173.32,173.46],["also",173.46,173.74],["read",173.74,173.98],["employees",173.98,174.34],["don't",174.34,174.6],["necessarily",174.6,174.96],["have",174.96,175.28],["to",175.28,175.4],["pay",175.4,175.56],["you",175.56,175.74],["anything,",175.74,176.14]]},{"start":176.54,"end":180.38,"text":"because you're not technically a real employee when you're doing work experience.","words":[["because",176.54,177.1],["you're",177.1,177.34],["not",177.34,177.46],["technically",177.46,177.98],["a",177.98,178.22],["real",178.22,178.34],["employee",178.34,178.78],["when",178.78,179.16],["you're",179.16,179.3],["doing",179.3,179.48],["work",179.48,179.7],["experience.",179.7,180.38]]},{"start":180.66,"end":183.56,"text":"Correct, but I haven't heard of that happening to anyone.","words":[["Correct,",180.66,181.08],["but",181.68,181.88],["I",181.88,182.0],["haven't",182.0,182.22],["heard",182.22,182.38],["of",182.38,182.5],["that",182.5,182.62],["happening",182.62,182.96],["to",182.96,183.2],["anyone.",183.2,183.56]]},{"start":184.1,"end":187.7,"text":"Unless you do IT work for some kind of volunteer organisation.","words":[["Unless",184.1,184.44],["you",184.44,184.66],["do",184.66,184.86],["IT",184.86,185.34],["work",185.34,185.72],["for",185.72,185.92],["some",185.92,186.06],["kind",186.06,186.3],["of",186.3,186.4],["volunteer",186.4,186.84],["organisation.",186.84,187.7]]},{"start":188.46,"end":192.28,"text":"I'd like to do that kind of thing, but not with my financial situation.","words":[["I'd",188.46,188.96],["like",188.96,189.22],["to",189.22,189.46],["do",189.46,189.6],["that",189.6,189.78],["kind",189.78,190.0],["of",190.0,190.12],["thing,",190.12,190.36],["but",190.46,190.64],["not",190.64,190.82],["with",190.82,190.98],["my",190.98,191.3],["financial",191.3,191.74],["situation.",191.74,192.28]]},{"start":192.72,"end":193.06,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",192.72,193.06]]},{"start":193.06,"end":202.16,"text":"But before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 25","words":[["But",193.06,193.14],["before",195.76,196.9],["you",196.9,197.14],["hear",197.14,197.46],["the",197.46,197.68],["rest",197.68,197.96],["of",197.96,198.1],["the",198.1,198.16],["discussion,",198.16,198.62],["you",199.26,199.46],["have",199.46,199.68],["some",199.68,199.86],["time",199.86,200.3],["to",200.3,200.58],["look",200.58,200.72],["at",200.72,200.86],["questions",200.86,201.2],["25",201.2,202.16]]},{"start":202.16,"end":236.92,"text":"to 30. Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30.","words":[["to",202.16,202.4],["30.",202.4,202.78],["Now",233.26,233.54],["listen",233.54,233.9],["and",233.9,234.32],["answer",234.32,234.78],["questions",234.78,235.22],["25",235.22,236.22],["to",236.22,236.52],["30.",236.52,236.92]]},{"start":240.26,"end":245.02,"text":"Okay, and once I've decided which company I want to do my work experience with, what's","words":[["Okay,",240.26,240.76],["and",241.04,241.22],["once",241.22,241.42],["I've",241.42,241.64],["decided",241.64,241.98],["which",241.98,242.22],["company",242.22,242.56],["I",242.56,242.72],["want",242.72,242.8],["to",242.8,242.94],["do",242.94,243.08],["my",243.08,243.24],["work",243.24,243.46],["experience",243.46,243.92],["with,",243.92,244.36],["what's",244.78,245.02]]},{"start":245.02,"end":250.04,"text":"the process? Do I have to fill a form out first, saying why I'd be interested to work","words":[["the",245.02,245.14],["process?",245.14,245.54],["Do",246.1,246.22],["I",246.22,246.36],["have",246.36,246.48],["to",246.48,246.62],["fill",246.62,246.86],["a",246.86,246.96],["form",246.96,247.24],["out",247.24,247.46],["first,",247.46,247.8],["saying",248.3,248.58],["why",248.58,248.82],["I'd",248.82,248.98],["be",248.98,249.12],["interested",249.12,249.5],["to",249.5,249.8],["work",249.8,250.04]]},{"start":250.04,"end":252.68,"text":"for the company and what kind of qualifications I have?","words":[["for",250.04,250.24],["the",250.24,250.34],["company",250.34,250.72],["and",250.72,250.92],["what",250.92,251.1],["kind",251.1,251.36],["of",251.36,251.48],["qualifications",251.48,251.96],["I",251.96,252.48],["have?",252.48,252.68]]},{"start":252.68,"end":258.88,"text":"Yes, you can ask your tutor for a standard one to use, or download one off the department's website.","words":[["Yes,",252.68,253.28],["you",253.76,253.96],["can",253.96,254.14],["ask",254.14,254.32],["your",254.32,254.5],["tutor",254.5,254.72],["for",254.72,254.98],["a",254.98,255.14],["standard",255.14,255.38],["one",255.38,255.64],["to",255.64,255.82],["use,",255.82,256.14],["or",256.28,256.72],["download",256.72,257.12],["one",257.12,257.46],["off",257.46,257.78],["the",257.78,257.96],["department's",257.96,258.5],["website.",258.5,258.88]]},{"start":259.28,"end":262.72,"text":"OK, then after that, do I have to sign something with the employer?","words":[["OK,",259.28,259.64],["then",260.02,260.18],["after",260.18,260.44],["that,",260.44,260.72],["do",260.98,261.12],["I",261.12,261.22],["have",261.22,261.34],["to",261.34,261.44],["sign",261.44,261.7],["something",261.7,262.02],["with",262.02,262.2],["the",262.2,262.34],["employer?",262.34,262.72]]},{"start":263.08,"end":267.28,"text":"Like something that guarantees I'll be given the work over a specific period of time?","words":[["Like",263.08,263.42],["something",263.42,263.76],["that",263.76,264.06],["guarantees",264.06,264.62],["I'll",264.62,264.88],["be",264.88,265.0],["given",265.0,265.2],["the",265.2,265.38],["work",265.38,265.6],["over",265.6,265.9],["a",265.9,266.08],["specific",266.08,266.4],["period",266.4,266.84],["of",266.84,267.0],["time?",267.0,267.28]]},{"start":267.72,"end":273.1,"text":"Actually, the next stage is you checking with the college that the kind of work you're applying for is appropriate.","words":[["Actually,",267.72,268.24],["the",268.3,268.42],["next",268.42,268.58],["stage",268.58,269.0],["is",269.0,269.38],["you",269.38,269.58],["checking",269.58,269.86],["with",269.86,270.12],["the",270.12,270.22],["college",270.22,270.52],["that",270.52,270.78],["the",270.78,270.92],["kind",270.92,271.16],["of",271.16,271.3],["work",271.3,271.54],["you're",271.54,271.82],["applying",271.82,272.08],["for",272.08,272.5],["is",272.5,272.66],["appropriate.",272.66,273.1]]},{"start":273.64,"end":277.3,"text":"So you'll need to send them a brief outline of what your responsibilities will be.","words":[["So",273.64,274.0],["you'll",274.0,274.14],["need",274.14,274.26],["to",274.26,274.4],["send",274.4,274.56],["them",274.56,274.72],["a",274.72,274.86],["brief",274.86,275.02],["outline",275.02,275.48],["of",275.48,275.74],["what",275.74,275.86],["your",275.86,276.02],["responsibilities",276.02,276.58],["will",276.58,277.02],["be.",277.02,277.3]]},{"start":277.58,"end":277.88,"text":"Alright.","words":[["Alright.",277.58,277.88]]},{"start":277.88,"end":282.86,"text":"And then, if the college approves, they'll speak to the company and get the name and","words":[["And",277.88,278.6],["then,",278.6,278.94],["if",279.08,279.38],["the",279.38,279.5],["college",279.5,279.7],["approves,",279.7,280.36],["they'll",280.76,280.98],["speak",280.98,281.18],["to",281.18,281.36],["the",281.36,281.48],["company",281.48,281.86],["and",281.86,282.32],["get",282.32,282.4],["the",282.4,282.52],["name",282.52,282.74],["and",282.74,282.86]]},{"start":282.86,"end":285.62,"text":"email address of the managers that'll be in charge of you.","words":[["email",282.86,283.14],["address",283.14,283.44],["of",283.44,283.68],["the",283.68,283.78],["managers",283.78,284.1],["that'll",284.1,284.58],["be",284.58,284.76],["in",284.76,284.96],["charge",284.96,285.24],["of",285.24,285.46],["you.",285.46,285.62]]},{"start":286.02,"end":289.44,"text":"OK, so after that, is there some kind of interview?","words":[["OK,",286.02,286.42],["so",286.9,287.3],["after",287.3,287.7],["that,",287.7,287.94],["is",288.08,288.18],["there",288.18,288.4],["some",288.4,288.74],["kind",288.74,288.98],["of",288.98,289.08],["interview?",289.08,289.44]]},{"start":289.9,"end":292.88,"text":"No, but the company are legally responsible for you.","words":[["No,",289.9,290.28],["but",290.58,290.8